---
---

<section id="features" class="section features-section">
      <div class="section-label">Core Systems</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Everything automated.<br /><span class="grad-text"
          >Nothing manual.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-sub">
        Three orchestrated systems working in parallel so your only job is to
        show up and execute.
      </p>

      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feat-card feat-large">
          <div class="feat-icon-wrap" style="--icon-clr:#6366f1">
            <svg
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path
                d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"
              ></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line
                x1="16"
                y1="13"
                x2="8"
                y2="13"></line><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line><line
                x1="10"
                y1="9"
                x2="8"
                y2="9"></line></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3>AI Orchestration</h3>
          <p>
            Drop a PDF. Our n8n pipeline extracts every learning objective,
            chunks it into bite-sized daily modules, and structures a full
            roadmap — all without a single manual step.
          </p>
          <ul class="feat-bullets">
            <li>Semantic chunking via OpenAI / Gemini</li>
            <li>Configurable hours-per-day and target date</li>
            <li>Structured JSON objectives per module</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="feat-card">
          <div class="feat-icon-wrap" style="--icon-clr:#8b5cf6">
            <svg
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"
              ></rect><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line><line
                x1="8"
                y1="2"
                x2="8"
                y2="6"></line><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3>Calendar Sync</h3>
          <p>
            Your roadmap is automatically pushed to Google Calendar as timed
            study events with full sub-topic descriptions.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feat-card">
          <div class="feat-icon-wrap" style="--icon-clr:#6366f1">
            <svg
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"
              ></polygon></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3>Gamified Recall</h3>
          <p>
            Quizzes auto-unlock after each scheduled event passes. Three
            question types. Instant feedback. Streak multipliers on every
            correct answer.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feat-card">
          <div class="feat-icon-wrap" style="--icon-clr:#8b5cf6">
            <svg
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"
              ></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path
                d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path
                d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3>Progression Engine</h3>
          <p>
            Consistency Combos, Elo points, and ranked milestones that climb
            from Iron all the way to Mythic. Achievement titles unlock as you
            hit milestones.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

<style>
/* ── FEATURES ── */
  .features-section {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: auto auto;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .feat-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.75rem;
    transition:
      border-color 0.3s,
      box-shadow 0.3s,
      transform 0.3s,
      opacity 0.4s;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
  }

  .feat-card.revealed {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .feat-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
    box-shadow: 0 0 32px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.08);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .feat-large {
    grid-column: 1 / 3;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .feat-icon-wrap {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
    background: rgba(from var(--icon-clr) r g b / 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(from var(--icon-clr) r g b / 0.2);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--icon-clr, var(--indigo));
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .feat-card h3 {
    font-family: "Syne", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .feat-card p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .feat-bullets {
    list-style: none;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .feat-bullets li {
    font-size: 0.83rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    padding-left: 1rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .feat-bullets li::before {
    content: "→";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--indigo);
  }
</style>